      "value": "I have two PCs on the same VRChat build. One works normally, while the other had the exact same black screen with audio still working.\n\nOn the affected PC, the login UI was apparently still there even though it was invisible. I guessed where the \"Login with Steam\" button was and clicked it, waited a few seconds, and VRChat logged in and started working normally.\n\nMight be worth trying if you're still stuck on the black screen.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
    {
